 programs. Commencing right away Solid will receive funding from a number of new sponsors including Google&#x27;s Chrome Aurora fund as well as Eraser Labs. Funding from thes...</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 emApzL" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/solid/updates/solid-fellowships-updates-and-new-chrome-aurora-funding">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on July 18, 2023 by <a title="David Di Biase" class="hover:underline" href="/davedbase">David Di Biase</a></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 CaGOk"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jzMvMa csvMWi"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 qIesT"><a title="David Di Biase" class="hover:underline" href="/davedbase"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/davedbase/d845654/avatar.png?height=80);background-size:cover" size="40" type="INDIVIDUAL" src="https://images.opencollective.com/davedbase/d845654/avatar.png?height=80" title="David Di Biase" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jFejKr fGEJMP sc-ff045f41-0 fEQhME"></div></a></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 giVqMW eDZLcq"><a href="/solid/updates/announcing-solid-fellowships"><p color="black.900" font-weight="600" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 hAeQmn">Announcing Solid Fellowships</p></a><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 dgVncz"><div><div style="display:inline" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 lmrrds">The SolidJS Core and Ecosystem Teams are excited to announce the launch of a new program to support SolidJS development. 2022 has been an exceptional year for the project&#x27;s growth. As adoption continues to increase, Core&#x27;s direct focus is t...</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 emApzL" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/solid/updates/announcing-solid-fellowships">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on September 25, 2022 by <a title="David Di Biase" class="hover:underline" 