 year for the project's growth. As adoption continues to increase, Core's direct focus is t...","createdAt":"2022-09-25T13:15:57.335Z","publishedAt":"2022-09-25T13:16:16.312Z","isPrivate":false,"userCanSeeUpdate":true,"fromAccount":{"__ref":"Individual:vjrkx5lm-nv904qjx-4o68bwa7-zdygoe3d"}},"Update:0n4gx0br-ov5m96nx-74qd8lk3-ey7jzwan":{"__typename":"Update","id":"0n4gx0br-ov5m96nx-74qd8lk3-ey7jzwan","slug":"solidhack-2022-winners-announced","title":"SolidHack 2022 winners announced and funds transferred!","summary":"SolidJS has made its mark on the JavaScript ecosystem. It's a flourishing community and we everyone to be a part of it. We know that this kind of remote/long-term hackathon initiative is somewhat new for the open-source world, and we're loo...","createdAt":"2022-05-07T14:18:35.637Z","publishedAt":"2022-05-07T14:23:39.937Z","isPrivate":false,"userCanSeeUpdate":true,"fromAccount":{"__ref":"Individual:vjrkx5lm-nv904qjx-4o68bwa7-zdygoe3d"}},"Collective:88rzownx-l9e50pxm-o3j6ymvb-dgk7j43a":{"__typename":"Collective","id":"88rzownx-l9e50pxm-o3j6ymvb-dgk7j43a","updates({\"limit\":3,\"onlyPublishedUpdates\":true})":{"__typename":"UpdateCollection","nodes":[{"__ref":"Update:0n4gx0br-ov5m96nw-my6d8lk3-ey7jzwan"},{"__ref":"Update:eeng0kzd-yvor4pzj-8gqbma83-7xlw95jl"},{"__ref":"Update:0n4gx0br-ov5m96nx-74qd8lk3-ey7jzwan"}]},"slug":"solid","hasPublicProfile":true,"name":"SolidJS","type":"COLLECTIVE","imageUrl":"https://images.opencollective.com/solid/c70e0e8/logo.png","isIncognito":false,"settings":{"features":{"conversations":true},"githubRepo":"ryansolid/solid","collectivePage":{"background":{"crop":{"x":18,"y":-36},"zoom":1,"mediaSize":{"width":723,"height":544},"isAlignedRight":true}}},"host":{"__ref":"Host:8a47byg9-nxozdp80-xm6mjlv0-3rek5w8k"},"hostFeePercent":10,"publicId":"acc_SVZkFHX0kbSIfyICJ9oka","legalName":null,"description":"Support development of the SolidJS UI Library","isHost":false,"isArchived":false,"isVerified":false,"approvedAt":"2020-10-24T06:06: